    "text": "<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2aIbzeQY78|The Proof is in the Universal Frontend>\n\nTutuca ships with everything required to instantiate any application \"Just In Time\" in the browser without any global state:\n\n- Components can compose without knowing about each other using a \"Component Selector\"\n- Compile and register components on the fly\n- Compile Tailwind classes at runtime\n- Register custom CSS &amp; Web Components\n- Listen to new and custom events\n- Manage lifecycle events",
